10:32:59:  text, key=Dropping Agent! Escort her and crush every remaining enemy base! text=特工伞降中！护送她，粉碎敌军剩余的所有据点！
10:32:59:  text, key=Fire for effect text=请求炮火增援
10:32:59:  text, key=full battery, sustained barrage, danger close. text=全炮组持续齐射，注意弹幕距离。
10:32:59:  text, key=Copy, battery firing for effect. text=收到，打击就绪中。
10:32:59:  text, key=Sustained barrage inbound, keep your heads down. text=持续弹幕来袭，注意隐蔽！
10:32:59:  text, key=requesting the ranger squad. text=请求游骑兵小队增援。
10:32:59:  text, key=Roger, rangers on the way. text=收到，游骑兵已出发。
10:32:59:  text, key=Dropping rangers. text=游骑兵空降中。
10:32:59:  text, key=Airdropping supplies now! text=正在空投补给！
10:32:59:  text, key=Requesting heavy airstrike text=请求重型空袭
10:32:59:  text, key=bring the big ones. text=把大家伙带来。
10:32:59:  text, key=Roger, F-22 inbound with heavy ordnance. text=收到，F-22挂载重型弹药进场。
10:32:59:  text, key=Bombs away, clear the area! text=炸弹投下，快撤离目标区域！
10:32:59:  text, key=F-22 airstrike (2x8) text=F-22空袭（1x12）
