10:33:04:  comment, key=cargo_truck.vehicle spotted, instructions text=截获运货卡车并护送到军械库，别把它搞炸了！
10:33:04:  comment, key=radar_tower.vehicle spotted, instructions text=摧毁信号塔！
10:33:04:  comment, key=radar_truck.vehicle spotted, instructions text=摧毁雷达车，别让它溜了！
10:33:04:  comment, key=radio_jammer.vehicle spotted, instructions text=摧毁无线电干扰发生器！
10:33:04:  comment, key=radio_jammer.vehicle destroyed text=干得漂亮！无线电干扰发生器已摧毁！
10:33:04:  comment, key=radio_jammer2.vehicle spotted, instructions text=炸掉无线电干扰发生器！
10:33:04:  comment, key=radio_jammer2.vehicle destroyed text=做得好！无线电干扰发生器已摧毁！
10:33:04:  comment, key=prison_bus.vehicle spotted, instructions text=摧毁运囚车！
10:33:04:  comment, key=prison_bus.vehicle destroyed text=太棒了！救出的囚犯会加入我们的队伍！
10:33:04:  comment, key=prison_door.vehicle spotted, instructions text=炸掉监狱大门！
10:33:04:  comment, key=prison_door.vehicle destroyed text=干得好！救出的囚犯会加入我们的队伍！
10:33:04:  comment, key=aa_emplacement.vehicle spotted, instructions text=摧毁防空设施我们才能使用无线电支援！
10:33:04:  comment, key=aa_emplacement.vehicle destroyed text=干得好！防空炮已摧毁，我们可以使用无线电支援了！
10:33:04:  comment, key=intel radio reminder text=别忘了在需要的时候呼叫增援或者火力支援
10:33:04:  comment, key=report very weak defense text=情报显示，%base_name区域几乎没有设防
10:33:04:  comment, key=respond very weak defense text=冲啊！占领基地！
10:33:04:  comment, key=report weak defense text=情报显示，%base_name区域防守力量薄弱，只有%enemy_range名敌军活动
10:33:04:  comment, key=respond weak defense text=去占领基地吧，全靠你了！
10:33:04:  comment, key=report medium defense text=情报显示，%base_name区域防守力量较强，有%enemy_range名敌军活动
10:33:04:  comment, key=respond medium defense text=如果你觉得可以做到的话就去占领基地吧
10:33:04:  comment, key=report heavy defense text=情报显示，%base_name区域防守固若金汤，人太多数不过来了
10:33:04:  comment, key=respond heavy defense text=保重！
10:33:04:  comment, key=base captured, clear victory, attack break text=集结部队，在基地周边设防，等待进一步指示。
10:33:04:  comment, key=base captured, defend it text=保护基地，建立防御！
10:33:04:  comment, key=sidebase captured, hold it text=保护基地，防御一切可能的反攻。
10:33:04:  comment, key=sidebase captured, reinforcements text=援军正在路上
10:33:04:  comment, key=Occupy that vehicle! text=战士，使用%vehicle_name！
10:33:04:  comment, key=Leave the vehicle! text=战士，离开%vehicle_name！
