10:33:04:  comment, key=resource out of stock, default text=%resource_name 已从军械库下架
10:33:04:  comment, key=resource out of stock, supply text=%resource_name 已不可在补给车内购买
10:33:04:  comment, key=resource added in stock, default text=%resource_name 现已上架军械库
