10:34:45:  comment, key=map advance, friendly map text=%map_name已被%faction_name占领, 那里终于平静些了
10:34:45:  comment, key=Final mission I advance, held by enemy, part 1 text=%faction_name已经被成功击退，各小队快速收拢，清点损失。
10:34:45:  comment, key=Final mission I advance, held by enemy, part 2 text=根据WAVE的情报分析，我们发现了敌方的一个重要指挥节点
10:34:45:  comment, key=Final mission I advance, held by enemy, part 3 text=我们不能让人形毫无意义的损失在与敌方的正面冲突中，破坏这个节点会改变作战态势
10:34:45:  comment, key=Final mission I advance, held by enemy, part 4 text=按照指挥官命令，精锐人形将会被抽调到这次任务中
10:34:45:  comment, key=Final mission I advance, held by enemy, part 5 text=清点剩余弹药、激活备用傀儡，十五分钟后出发
10:34:45:  comment, key=Final mission I start with 1 base, part 1 text=啧，指挥节点怎么可能没有防空设施
10:34:45:  comment, key=Final mission I start with 1 base, part 2 text=两天不睡果然会导致作战误判……
10:34:45:  comment, key=Final mission I start with 1 base, part 3 text=我方损失很大，只有一部分人形还可以执行任务
10:34:45:  comment, key=Final mission I start with 1 base, part 4 text=附近空域被军方封锁，战术妖精的支援无法进入这一区域，但不摧毁这里整个格里芬都玩完了
10:34:45:  comment, key=Final mission I start with 1 base, part 5 text=找到并摧毁分散在这个地区的通讯装置，尽全力消灭敌人
10:34:45:  comment, key=Operation Homecoming advance, held by enemy, part 1 text=漂亮！%faction_name已经成功被击退
10:34:45:  comment, key=Operation Homecoming advance, held by enemy, part 2 text=WAVE的设备发现%faction_name指挥信号出现于雪山地域
10:34:45:  comment, key=Operation Homecoming advance, held by enemy, part 3 text=先期派往的SASS小队陷入了苦战，正在利用一个废弃基地组织防御
10:34:45:  comment, key=Operation Homecoming advance, held by enemy, part 4 text=所有剩余的主力梯队，立刻动身前往那里！
10:34:45:  comment, key=Operation Homecoming advance, held by enemy, part 5 text=……做好付出重大牺牲的准备
10:34:45:  comment, key=Operation Homecoming start with 1 base, part 1 text=增援梯队已到达！
10:34:45:  comment, key=Operation Homecoming start with 1 base, part 2 text=敌人快要冲进基地了，SASS和NTW她们刚刚很勉强地守住了这里的战线
10:34:45:  comment, key=Operation Homecoming start with 1 base, part 3 text=敌人的下一次反扑马上就要开始了
10:34:45:  comment, key=Operation Homecoming start with 1 base, part 4 text=利用掩体与重装人形，保护好自己，打击敌人
10:34:45:  comment, key=Operation Homecoming start with 1 base, part 5 text=
10:34:45:  comment, key=Operation Homecoming, phase 2, part 1 text=看起来敌方的攻势慢慢减弱了
10:34:45:  comment, key=Operation Homecoming, phase 2, part 2 text=他们现在似乎转而组织防御
10:34:45:  comment, key=Operation Homecoming, phase 2, part 3 text=趁他们还没有站稳脚跟，组织精英人形开始反击！
10:34:45:  comment, key=Operation Homecoming, phase 2, part 4 text=防空系统阻止了一部分战术妖精呼叫的增援，摧毁它
10:34:45:  comment, key=Operation Homecoming, phase 2, part 5 text=WAVE侦测到了敌方的通讯设备，找到并摧毁它
10:34:45:  comment, key=Operation Homecoming, phase 3, part 1 text=他们退到了大门后面，重装人形可以炸开障碍，但他们似乎还布置了强力的干扰协议
