10:34:46:  comment, key=intel objectives text=需要侦查的敌方基地已经标注在地图上了，侦查小队执行任务时注意安全！
10:34:46:  comment, key=icecream truck exists text=哇，是冰淇淋！
10:34:46:  comment, key=gps_laptop, targets ok text=标记目标中
10:34:46:  comment, key=gps_laptop, targets not ok text=未搜寻到任何目标
10:34:46:  comment, key=resource out of stock, default text=%resource_name 库存用尽
10:34:46:  comment, key=resource out of stock, supply text=%resource_name 库存用尽
