10:34:46:  comment, key=rangefinder binoculars text=距离目标: %range m.
10:34:46:  comment, key=squad_equipment_kit, equip text=我可以用这个来给附近的人形装备护甲！
10:34:46:  comment, key=squad_equipment_kit, done text=护甲发放完毕！
