10:34:46:  comment, key=sf_jupiter.vehicle spotted, instructions text=摧毁木星才能让一部分战术妖精呼叫支援
10:34:46:  comment, key=sf_jupiter.vehicle destroyed text=木星已摧毁，战术妖精已与支援系统建立连接
10:34:46:  comment, key=par_sentrytower.vehicle spotted, instructions text=摧毁哨戒指挥塔才能让一部分战术妖精呼叫支援
10:34:46:  comment, key=par_sentrytower.vehicle destroyed text=哨戒塔楼已摧毁，战术妖精已与支援系统建立连接
