10:34:47:  comment, key=sf_jupiter.vehicle spotted, instructions text=摧毁木星才能让一部分战术妖精呼叫支援
10:34:47:  comment, key=sf_jupiter.vehicle destroyed text=木星已摧毁，战术妖精已与支援系统建立连接
