10:34:47:  comment, key=Leave the vehicle! text=离开%vehicle_name！
10:34:47:  comment, key=intel objectives text=需要侦查的敌方基地已经标注在地图上了，侦查小队执行任务时注意安全！
10:34:47:  comment, key=icecream truck exists text=哇，是冰淇淋！
10:34:47:  comment, key=gps_laptop, targets ok text=标记目标中
10:34:47:  comment, key=gps_laptop, targets not ok text=未搜寻到任何目标
