10:34:47:  comment, key=intel radio reminder text=别忘了在需要的时候呼叫战术妖精支援
10:34:47:  comment, key=report very weak defense text=情报显示，%base_name区域几乎没有设防。
10:34:47:  comment, key=respond very weak defense text=占领基地
10:34:47:  comment, key=report weak defense text=情报显示，%base_name区域防守力量薄弱，只有%enemy_range名敌军活动。
10:34:47:  comment, key=respond weak defense text=去占领基地吧
10:34:47:  comment, key=report medium defense text=情报显示，%base_name区域防守力量较强, 有%enemy_range名敌军活动。
10:34:47:  comment, key=respond medium defense text=注意自身安全！
10:34:47:  comment, key=report heavy defense text=情报显示，%base_name区域防守严密
10:34:47:  comment, key=respond heavy defense text=优先保护自己！
10:34:47:  comment, key=base captured, clear victory, attack break text=集结梯队，在基地周边设防，等待进一步指示。
10:34:47:  comment, key=base captured, defend it text=保护基地，各梯队原地建立防御！
10:34:47:  comment, key=sidebase captured, hold it text=保护基地，以各梯队为单位，防御一切可能的反攻。
10:34:47:  comment, key=sidebase captured, reinforcements text=援军正在路上
10:34:47:  comment, key=Occupy that vehicle! text=使用%vehicle_name！
10:34:47:  comment, key=Leave the vehicle! text=离开%vehicle_name！
10:34:47:  comment, key=intel objectives text=需要侦查的敌方基地已经标注在地图上了，侦查小队执行任务时注意安全！
